	(910, 39, 'Patinoires du parc Notre-Dame-de-Grâce', 'Aire de patinage libre', 'PPL', 'Aire de patinage libre, Notre-Dame-de-Grâce (PPL)', 45.47295980987, -73.615426838847, '2025-01-09 17:31:32.454827', 'https://sgstggxmzmcyctxzjbog.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/static-maps/45.47295980987--73.615426838847', '[{"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Monday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Tuesday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Wednesday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Thursday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Friday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Saturday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "06:00", "closes": "00:00", "dayOfWeek": "Sunday"}]', '{}', 'Le parc Notre-Dame-de-Grâce compte deux patinoires qui se situent sur l&#8217;espace du terrain de baseball au nord-est du parc, près du chemin de la Côte-Saint-Antoine. Elles permettent la pratique d&#8217;une variété de sports sur glace lors de la saison hivernale.', '3500, avenue Girouard, Montréal, QC, CA, H4A1R2', 'Aire de patinage libre', 'Free skating area', 'Patinoires du parc Notre-Dame-de-Grâce', 'Patinoires du parc Notre-Dame-de-Grâce', 'Le parc Notre-Dame-de-Grâce compte deux patinoires qui se situent sur l&#8217;espace du terrain de baseball au nord-est du parc, près du chemin de la Côte-Saint-Antoine. Elles permettent la pratique d&#8217;une variété de sports sur glace lors de la saison hivernale.', 'Notre-Dame-de-Grâce Park has two skating rinks located on the baseball field area northeast of the park, near Côte-Saint-Antoine Road. They allow for a variety of ice sports to be practiced during the winter season.', true, '0101000020E61000