	(1112, 55, 'Pavillon du Lac-aux-Castors', 'Patinoire réfrigérée', 'PP', 'Patinoire réfrigérée, Lac aux Castors , (PP)', 45.498254843107, -73.599028126288, '2025-01-09 17:31:33.042641', 'https://sgstggxmzmcyctxzjbog.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/static-maps/45.498254843107--73.599028126288', '[{"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "21:00", "dayOfWeek": "Monday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "21:00", "dayOfWeek": "Tuesday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "21:00", "dayOfWeek": "Wednesday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "21:00", "dayOfWeek": "Thursday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "22:00", "dayOfWeek": "Friday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "22:00", "dayOfWeek": "Saturday"}, {"@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification", "opens": "08:30", "closes": "21:00", "dayOfWeek": "Sunday"}]', '{SNACK_BAR,PLAYGROUND_KIDS,PLAYGROUND_TODDLERS,PAID_PARKING,TOILETS,CHANGING_ROOM,FREE_WIFI}', 'Le pavillon du Lac-aux-Castors est un joyau architectural moderne. Situé au bord du lac aux Castors et construit sur deux étages, il a été entièrement restauré. Des artistes québécois de renom signent les cinq murales extérieures. À l&#8217;étage, la façade vitrée du café offre un cadre enchanteur.', '2000, chemin Remembrance, Montréal, QC, CA, H3H1X2', 'Patinoire réfrigérée', 'Refrigerated ice rink', 'Pavillon du Lac-aux-Castors', 'Pavillon du Lac-aux-Castors', 'Le pavillon du Lac-aux-Castors est un joyau architectural moderne. Situé au bord du lac aux Castors et construit sur deux étages, il a été entièrement restauré. Des artistes québécois de renom signent les cinq murales extérieures. À l&#8217;étage, la façade vitrée du café offre un cadre enchanteur.', 'The Beaver Lake Pavilion is a modern architectural gem. Located on the shores of Beaver Lake and built on two floors, it has been completely restored. Renowned Quebec artists have painted the five exterior murals. Upstairs, the glass façade of the café offers an enchanting setting.', true, '0101000020E6100000A2F2107A566652C0ED1B90D0C6BF4640'),
